        <segment id="1" parent="9" relname="span">Good observation P49.</segment>
        <segment id="2" parent="1" relname="elaboration">There's a lot of bad looking sights out there.</segment>
        <segment id="3" parent="13" relname="span">And I agree with the majority of what you just commented about.</segment>
        <segment id="4" parent="10" relname="span">I really hate the bright flashy ads at the top of websites too.</segment>
        <segment id="5" parent="12" relname="span">They really think that a person will just jump to that particular link</segment>
        <segment id="6" parent="5" relname="volitional-cause">just because its flashing.</segment>
        <segment id="7" parent="12" relname="volitional-result">And that insults a person's intelligence I think</segment>
